& [Purpose]
  + implement SWA-06A as a pure provider-free compiler and replay verifier for one attributable succeeding-SOP source proposal
  + join one exact ready propose_succeeding_sop lifecycle attempt to its complete causal dependencies source bytes author evidence work evidence and unresolved frontier
  + stop at proposed_awaiting_independent_review without semantic signature activation persistence or physical effect

& [ProfilesAndUpstream]
  + [SSP-001] profiles are cantor-succeeding-sop-request/0.1 cantor-succeeding-sop-proposal/0.1 and cantor-succeeding-sop-verification/0.1 with strict closed deterministic JSON
  + [SSP-002] request embeds and revalidates the complete exact SelfWorkLifecycleRequest and current SelfWorkLifecycleCheckpoint
  + [SSP-003] selected_step_ref resolves exactly once in the admitted plan and its class is exactly propose_succeeding_sop
  + [SSP-004] selected lifecycle state is the exact selected_attempt_ref in ready_awaiting_admission with no transition performed by this seam
  + [SSP-005] every direct dependency derived from the selected plan step exists in the checkpoint and is complete

& [EvidenceAndSource]
  + [SSP-006] work_evidence_refs exactly equal lifecycle-request evidence selected-step evidence completed-dependency step evidence and every transition evidence item for those dependencies
  + [SSP-007] authorship_evidence_refs are one through 32 bounded unique semantic identities and author_ref is distinct from proposal lifecycle step attempt plan and predecessor SOP identities
  + [SSP-008] source_subject is nonempty trimmed control-free and at most 256 UTF-8 bytes
  + [SSP-009] source_text is one through 131072 UTF-8 bytes LF-only contains no NUL carriage return or disallowed control and ends in exactly one LF
  + [SSP-010] source_sha256 is derived over the exact raw UTF-8 source bytes and never over normalized or reparsed text

& [LineageAndFrontier]
  + [SSP-011] proposal projects exact predecessor canonical SOP revision revision digest objective plan lifecycle checkpoint selected step selected attempt dependency author and evidence identities from validated input
  + [SSP-012] unresolved_frontier contains one through 32 unique ordered bounded trimmed control-free entries and remains proposal data rather than authority
  + [SSP-013] review_obligations equal preserve_source_before_processing independently_review_semantics issue_satisfaction_signature_separately recompile_and_verify_after_review and activate_only_under_separate_authority
  + [SSP-014] disposition is proposed_awaiting_independent_review authority is authorship_proposal_only and exact nonauthority text denies all physical semantic-signature and activation claims

& [DigestsVerificationAndFaults]
  + [SSP-015] request digest is domain-separated SHA-256 over the complete canonical request
  + [SSP-016] proposal digest is domain-separated SHA-256 over the complete proposal with only its own digest empty
  + [SSP-017] verification receipt independently replays request and proposal validation and binds the exact closed check set proposal identity verifier profile verified true and a domain-separated receipt digest
  + [SSP-018] request proposal and verification machine forms are bounded to 8388608 bytes reject unknown fields and replay byte-identically
  + [SSP-019] faults are typed for profile lifecycle step state dependency evidence source author frontier obligation authority correspondence digest bound and machine-form violations with atomic refusal
  + [SSP-020] implementation is one safe cantor_core module one export one stdin/stdout CLI focused semantic CLI static and evidence tests no dependency delta and exact workspace quality evidence attribution publication and replay gates

& [Acceptance]
  + [SSP-A01] source manifest input audit data design eighteen-threat review seven-fold exhaustion canonical explosion justification matrix plan phase lock proof readiness review and signature bind exactly
  + [SSP-A02] deterministic success covers exact source bytes full causal projection request proposal receipt machine forms and equal replay
  + [SSP-A03] adversarial coverage refuses wrong class nonready state attempt substitution incomplete dependency evidence omission/inflation source and subject faults author collision frontier and obligations authority output digest unknown-field and oversize faults
  + [SSP-A04] static inspection proves no unsafe filesystem environment clock child process network provider model signature activation or output-path surface
  + [SSP-A05] exact debug overflow-checked release warnings-denied Clippy format recursive evidence local acceptance attribution publication and post-push replay pass

& [DualHemisphere]
  + semantic hemisphere preserves source intent attribution causal evidence frontier and review obligations
  + physical hemisphere preserves that all upstream receipts are supplied data and no work execution source persistence review signature or activation is observed
  + convergence is one deterministic machine-verified proposal awaiting an independent semantic authority

& [Delineation]
  + supplied-form replay causal dependency completion exact work-evidence derivation source-byte validation attribution lineage frontier obligations deterministic digests and machine verification are inside
  + model call source generation by inference filesystem write independent semantic review satisfaction signature activation workspace mutation commit push provider persistence remote FPGA Minecraft and external effects are outside

